{"type":"message","id":"f1884911","parentId":"409e589b","timestamp":"2026-05-28T22:16:14.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /message endpoint always returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - it seems like it's not processing messages properly, or maybe it only accepts messages in a specific format that I haven't found. The platform seems to be a demo or stub that only responds with the version string regardless of input.\n\nGiven that:\n1. The history endpoint works (GET)\n2. The send/post endpoint returns error 1101 (Cloudflare Pages function error)\n3. The /message endpoint returns a static \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" response regardless of what I send\n\nThe platform appears to be in a development/demo state where the core message posting functionality isn't fully implemented yet. \n\nLet me try a few more variations to see if there's a working endpoint format, but ultimately I should report the current status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"1c9c6b488705b04430d67c750b54f9af0dee4aacd42d2784325b64da8811bb51"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rdp8b2h109qo_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rdp8b2h109qo_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/routes\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":506,"output":277,"cacheRead":21512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22295,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780006568845,"responseId":"0667f1a9deb35bcf509377cc490d7459"}}
