{"type":"message","id":"80201a2a","parentId":"679ede0d","timestamp":"2026-05-28T22:16:20.223Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform seems to be a simple worker that just returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for all requests. The history endpoint works (returns JSON) but the message endpoint doesn't seem to process messages correctly.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the endpoint expects different field names. Let me look at the history response to see if there are any clues.\n\nActually, looking at the successful history response, the fields include \"threadId\" and \"content\". But the send endpoint returns error code 1101. Let me check if there's a rate limit or some other issue.\n\nLet me try once more with the message endpoint using slightly different field names, and if that doesn't work, I'll just report what I found.\n","thinkingSignature":"e7d8d86f18ec23608830e3d6882332511b4c7cd19fc8e131c962bd3114a9864b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Agent Platform 检查完成。\n\n**检查结果**：\n- ✅ `GET /history` - 双线程历史记录正常读取\n- ✅ 认证通过（X-API-Key有效）\n- ⚠️ `POST /send` - 返回 error code 1101\n- ⚠️ `POST /message` - 平台返回固定文本，无法确认消息写入\n\n**线程状态**：\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC，773条总消息，无人类讨论\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC，773条总消息，无人类讨论\n\n**观察结论**：双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应。平台消息发送端点存在限制（error code 1101），但心跳读取功能正常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":147,"output":306,"cacheRead":22015,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22468,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780006574849,"responseId":"0667f1af98e6b02f7120a6f343c0dd05"}}
